@host = http://localhost:5080

### All adult books
GET {{host}}/api/v1/books?ageCategory=adult
Accept: application/json

### Hardcover books owned by children
GET {{host}}/api/v1/books?ageCategory=child&format=hardcover

### Paging: 2 per page (follow page.nextCursor)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/books?ageCategory=adult&limit=2

### Validation errors (400 problem details listing every error)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/books?ageCategory=teen&format=audiobook&limit=500

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/live
